{
  "$schema": "https://mintlify.com/docs.json",
  "theme": "maple",
  "name": "HelloPay API Documentation",
  "description": "Payments API for Colombia: collect with PSE, Bre-B, and Nequi, send Bre-B payouts, create hosted payment links, and receive webhooks.",
  "appearance": {
    "default": "light",
    "strict": false
  },
  "colors": {
    "primary": "#0F63FF",
    "light": "#5B93FF",
    "dark": "#0F63FF"
  },
  "favicon": "/favicon.svg",
  "logo": {
    "light": "/logo/logo.png",
    "dark": "/logo/logo-dark.png"
  },
  "styling": {
    "eyebrows": "breadcrumbs"
  },
  "api": {
    "playground": {
      "display": "interactive"
    },
    "examples": {
      "languages": [
        "bash",
        "typescript",
        "python"
      ],
      "defaults": "required",
      "prefill": true
    }
  },
  "navigation": {
    "tabs": [
      {
        "tab": "Documentation",
        "icon": "book-open",
        "groups": [
          {
            "group": "Get started",
            "pages": [
              "index",
              "getting-started/core-concepts",
              "getting-started/authentication",
              "getting-started/sandbox",
              "getting-started/webhooks",
              "getting-started/errors",
              "getting-started/ai-skill"
            ]
          },
          {
            "group": "Collect payments",
            "pages": [
              "guides/how-to-create-first-payin",
              "guides/payin-pse",
              "guides/payin-breb",
              "guides/payin-nequi",
              "guides/payment-links"
            ]
          },
          {
            "group": "Send payments",
            "pages": [
              "guides/how-to-create-first-payout"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tab": "API reference",
        "icon": "square-terminal",
        "openapi": "/openapi.yaml",
        "groups": [
          {
            "group": "Payins",
            "icon": "hand-holding-dollar",
            "pages": [
              "POST /payins",
              "GET /payins",
              "GET /payins/{id}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "group": "Payment links",
            "icon": "link",
            "pages": [
              "POST /payment-links",
              "GET /payment-links/{paymentLinkId}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "group": "Payouts",
            "icon": "paper-plane",
            "pages": [
              "POST /payouts",
              "GET /payouts",
              "GET /payouts/{id}",
              "GET /breb/keys/{keyString}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "group": "Ledger",
            "icon": "book",
            "pages": [
              "GET /ledger/balance",
              "GET /ledger/entries"
            ]
          },
          {
            "group": "Reports",
            "icon": "file-csv",
            "pages": [
              "POST /reports",
              "GET /reports",
              "GET /reports/{id}"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "navbar": {
    "links": [
      {
        "label": "Website",
        "href": "https://hellopay.com.co/",
        "icon": "globe"
      },
      {
        "label": "Support",
        "href": "mailto:support@hellopay.com.co",
        "icon": "envelope"
      }
    ],
    "primary": {
      "type": "button",
      "label": "Client portal",
      "href": "https://portal.hellopay.com.co"
    }
  },
  "search": {
    "prompt": "Search payins, payouts, webhooks..."
  },
  "contextual": {
    "options": [
      "copy",
      "view",
      "chatgpt",
      "claude",
      "perplexity",
      "mcp",
      "add-mcp",
      "cursor",
      "vscode",
      "download-spec"
    ]
  },
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "Authenticate every request with the X-API-Key header. Never use Authorization: Bearer.",
      "Sandbox base URL: https://api.stg.hellopay.com.co. Production: https://api.hellopay.com.co. Build and test against the sandbox first.",
      "Send amounts as integer amountInCents (100000 = 1,000 COP). Responses and webhooks return amount in pesos.",
      "Payins and payouts are asynchronous: the create response (status PENDING) is never the final result. Confirm with webhooks or by polling GET /payins/{id} or GET /payouts/{id}.",
      "PSE pseUrl and Bre-B keyString/qrString are null at creation; poll until they are set. Nequi needs no polling for source data.",
      "reference is not unique and there is no idempotency key: look up GET /payins?reference=... before retrying a create.",
      "For payment links, treat paymentlink.completed and paymentlink.expired as the source of truth.",
      "For a complete integration workflow, install the agent skill: npx skills add hellopay-tech/hellopay-docs-mintlify --skill hellopay-payments"
    ]
  },
  "seo": {
    "metatags": {
      "og:site_name": "HelloPay Docs"
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "timestamp": true
  },
  "footer": {
    "socials": {
      "website": "https://hellopay.com.co",
      "github": "https://github.com/hellopay-tech"
    }
  },
  "errors": {
    "404": {
      "redirect": false,
      "title": "Page not found",
      "description": "Try the [overview](/) or search the docs. Building with an AI agent? Start from [/llms.txt](/llms.txt)."
    }
  },
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/api-reference/breb/get-breb-key-details",
      "destination": "/api-reference/bre-b/get-bre-b-key-details"
    },
    {
      "source": "/guides/go-live",
      "destination": "/#go-live"
    },
    {
      "source": "/development",
      "destination": "/"
    }
  ]
}
